/* Launcher resources, ported from Anomaly's apps/launcher/AnomalyLauncher.rc.in.
 *
 * 101 RCDATA -- the product logo.  apps/launcher/main.cpp reads it back as
 *               kLogoResourceId and draws it in the header.  Embedded at 32x32 because that is
 *               the size it is displayed at, exactly as upstream does with logo-header.png.
 * 201 ICON   -- the window and taskbar icon, used as kIconResourceId for the window class.
 *
 * The absolute paths are injected by CMake's configure_file(@ONLY) from
 * file(TO_CMAKE_PATH ...), because rc.exe resolves relative paths against its own working
 * directory rather than the source tree.
 */
101 RCDATA "@CABBIRD_PLATFORM_LOGO_PATH@"
201 ICON "@CABBIRD_LAUNCHER_ICON_PATH@"
